<title>USA: Greenspan testifies Jan 30 to Senate Finance panel.</title>
<headline>Greenspan testifies Jan 30 to Senate Finance panel.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Senate Finance Committee said Tuesday that Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan will testify at a hearing Jan. 30 on the U.S. economic and budget outlook.</p>
<p>The hearing is scheduled to begin at 1000 EST/1500 GMT.</p>
<p>Greenspan testified Tuesday at the Senate Budget Committee.</p>
